===A7_S2_D3===
Ada: Hey, you! Already used to the ocean I see! #portrait:Ada
Noelle: Spending time here has been really nice. #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Noelle: I’m used to busying myself with other things, and never really thought about my new features that much… #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Ada: Ha, your kind tends to be like that, sometimes. You’re like our slightly strange, overachieving cousins! #portrait:Ada
Narrator: You think about the way the Ichthyos like to bulldoze into the Krakenfolk and drop their scavenged items into their arms.
Noelle: I guess it’s a human thing to have too many concerns. #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Noelle: I can tell that you guys have helped out the Krakenfolk a lot. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Ada: Well… we’re the most energetic of the Thavma. And one could say the most ‘creature-like.’ #portrait:Ada
Ada: I guess we understand how small one can feel against the big, wide ocean. That’s why we always travel in packs! #portrait:Ada
Noelle: (They’re so free-willed that it’s almost healing.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: (Ah… things back home really were strict.) #portrait:NoelleUm
Ada: Your homeland isn’t fond of creatures, are they? #portrait:Ada
Ada: That must have been hard… I can’t imagine being treated differently just because of how I looked. #portrait:Ada
Narrator: Not wanting to bring the mood down, you give Ada a light smile.
Noelle: Well… if you want to cheer me up, maybe you can show me how you guys do that spinning thing that speeds you up. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: Is it hard? #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Ada: Oh, you just need to get the hang of it. #portrait:Ada
Ada: Zale loves that trick. Let’s find him and go through his favourite track! #portrait:Ada
Narrator: The trick is to swim fast enough to ‘move’ the current your way, then create a boost of energy that burrows you through the water at record speed.
Narrator: …At least, that is the best way to describe it, for one who isn’t experiencing it themself.
Narrator: Soon, the day wanes, and you finally resurface to find Amelia happily munching on grilled fish, which she’s taken to help grill over their firepits over the last few days.
Noelle: (Let’s talk to Amelia!) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
-> DONE